[SIZE="4"][B]Installation[/B][/SIZE]

[COLOR="Red"][B]Back up everything first (at least /data and the boot partition). Make sure the phone is a C660 / C660h.[/B][/COLOR]

[LIST=1]
[*]Install a custom recovery: [URL="TODO-TWRP-THREAD"]TWRP for the C660[/URL] (the stock-style CWM 5.0.2.7 also works).
[*]Copy the ROM ZIP to the microSD (the C660 has no internal storage) or use adb sideload from TWRP.
[*]Boot into recovery (Volume Down + Home + Power) and make a backup.
[*]Wipe data/factory reset, cache and Dalvik cache (needed the first time you come from stock).
[*]Install the ZIP, wipe cache and Dalvik cache again and reboot. The first boot takes about a minute.
[/LIST]

[COLOR="Red"][SIZE="5"][CENTER]Do not mirror the download without permission.[/CENTER][/SIZE][/COLOR]

