[SIZE="4"][B]What is different from other attempts[/B][/SIZE]

[LIST]
[*]The stock LG RIL blobs are used as they are; the framework only needed one extra case to understand a network-locked SIM (a one-line change in QualcommNoSimReadyRIL plus a Phone overlay).
[*]The camera preview needed a chroma swap in the camera service to show the right colours, and the video path was checked separately.
[*]The kernel is rebuilt with fixes for the "ANDROID_" console cursor, the charger-logo flicker and the keyboard ghost key.
[*]A small framework patch fixes the Bluetooth "Invalid discovery session" error that appeared when a scan ended.
[/LIST]

[SIZE="4"][B]Notes for developers[/B][/SIZE]

[LIST]
[*]The stock libril returns a 340-byte card status with GSM and CDMA subscription index lists, not the Gingerbread struct.
[*]The network-lock state shows up as app state SUBSCRIPTION_PERSO with perso substate SIM_NETWORK; QualcommNoSimReadyRIL did not handle it, so the SIM state stayed UNKNOWN.
[*]The recovery partition is only 5 MB, so a full TWRP does not fit with the stock recovery kernel; the TWRP thread explains the trimmed kernel.
[/LIST]

